title: 'Fix for `rust-lld` regression'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      Adapts the `#[runtime_interface]` macro to a `rust-lld` regression observed since Rust
      1.96.0, which requires the Wasm module that external functions are imported from to be
      specified explicitly. The generated `extern "C"` blocks now carry
      `#[link(wasm_import_module = "env")]` when compiling for `wasm32`.
crates:
  - name: sp-runtime-interface-proc-macro
    bump: patch
